<section id="1001A_S0009" variety="S0009">
<name>Lighting</name>
<ttl id="1001A_S0009_74212_T001K" variety="T001K">
<name>Automatic Light Control Sensor</name>
<para id="RM00000285P002X" category="G" type-id="8000T" name-id="603K9-00" from="200612">
<name>On-vehicle Inspection</name>
<subpara id="RM00000285P002X_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM00000285P002X_01_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___00009IO00000">
<ptxt>Inspect Automatic Light Control Sensor</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the voltage between the connector terminals. </ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E101505J04" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<atten3>
<ptxt>With the connector connected, inspect from the back side of the connector.</ptxt>
</atten3>
<spec>
<title>Voltage</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.35in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.44in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.34in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>1(CLTB) - 3(CLTE)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>IG ON</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>11 to 14 V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the connector terminal and body ground.</ptxt>
<atten3>
<ptxt>With the connector connected, inspect from the back side of the connector.</ptxt>
</atten3>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.33in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.48in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.32in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>3 (CLTE) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), inspect that a waveform is generated between the terminals.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<atten3>
<ptxt>With the connector connected, inspect from the back side of the connector.</ptxt>
</atten3>
<spec>
<title>Standard (Waveform)</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL3" align="center" colwidth="1.32in"/>
<colspec colname="COL5" colwidth="1.49in"/>
<colspec colname="COL6" colwidth="1.31in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
<ptxt>[Positive - Negative]</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>4(CLTS) - 3(CLTE)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>IG ON、</ptxt>
<ptxt>Headlight dimmer switch AUTO</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Pulse generation (waveform 1)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<s3>
<ptxt>Waveform 1</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E141421J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.43in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.70in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Item</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Description</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tool Setting</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>5V/DIV、5ms/DIV</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<atten4>
<ptxt>The width of A becomes narrower as the surroundings become brighter.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</s3>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
